title: "Cenorya: experimental wearable sensing for cuff blood-pressure measurement decisions"
abstract: >-
  Public overview, prototype roadmap, research status and demonstration plan
  for Cenorya, an early-stage wearable-sensing research project. It is not a
  medical device and makes no blood-pressure accuracy or clinical claim.
